note as FUTURE_TARGETS_diagram_09b_extensibility_governance
  HIGH-PROBABILITY FUTURE TARGETS
  Patient profiles; practitioner profiles; practitioner specialties;
  organizations, sites, units and spaces; encounters; observations and
  diagnostic reports; imaging studies and clinical media; service catalog;
  insurance coverage, prior authorizations and claims; devices/implants and
  UDI; staff competencies and rosters; home-care visits; patient-reported
  outcomes; research consent; public profiles and reviews; inventory lots;
  provider enrollment and jurisdiction-specific regulatory records.
end note

note as LIMIT_diagram_09b_extensibility_governance
  BOUNDARY
  Dynamic fields extend a known resource. They do not replace core clinical
  columns, terminology bindings, state machines, accounting invariants or
  authorization. High-value searchable fields should graduate into typed
  columns after evidence of stable use.
end note


